Package: LDRegularization
Type: Package
Title: Regularization of Linkage Disequilibrium Matrix
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yihe", "Yang", email = "yxy1234@case.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides methods for regularizing large-scale linkage
    disequilibrium (LD) matrices. It implements a variety of
    regularization techniques, including shrinkage, nonlinear shrinkage,
    banding, tapering, thresholding, standard POET extensions, and
    transfer learning for covariance matrices and eigenspaces, including
    tuning-free joint multi-source covariance shrinkage.
    The package enables efficient
    computation for high-dimensional LD matrix estimation via
    CppMatrix-backed matrix operations where possible.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: 
    R (>= 2.10)
Imports:
    CppMatrix,
    Rcpp
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp,
    RcppArmadillo
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
